window.SLATE_TEAMS_DOCS_INDEX = {"en":[{"t":"What SLATE Teams is","u":"01-what-is-teams.html","s":"Start","h":["The three things it is for","Six top-level tabs","How it relates to SLATE","Where your data is","Next"],"x":"SLATE Teams runs on your own machine . No server, nothing uploaded, model keys stay local. It makes one thing easy: several people and a crew of AI working at the same table — with a trace left behind for every decision. The wordmark is 席, which means both a seat at the table and the act of taking one. The interface follows the \"Ledger\" identity: graphite paper, red-ink annotations, square corners, hairline rules like a ledger page. The three things it is for Where What it owns Read --- --- --- Debate hall People and AI seats in one discussion; the host advances rounds; conclusions need a signature Team Office AI staff pick up work on their shift, every delivery passes a review, cost lands per employee Office Ledger Who said it, who approved it, how many tokens — stored, exportable, restorable Projects & data The debate hall is collaboration at the same moment — everyone in one discussion. The office is collaboration at different moments — you leave the work, an AI staff member does it on shift, you check it when you're back. Six top-level tabs - Chat — the ordinary one-to-one conversation: tool calls, approvals, context budget. - Team — the debate hall. Seats, the feed, and \"waiting for your signature\" in three columns. - Office — AI staff roster, duty schedule, hand-offs between desks, the delivery queue. - Board — spread a discussion into a reasoning chain and workflow nodes. - Extensions — skills, MCP servers, built-in tools, reply modes, experts: capabilities live here. - Settings — models, theme, language, data & privacy, and each token-spending AI feature. How it relates to SLATE SLATE Teams is a sibling of SLATE. They share the base — chat, tools, skills, board, data layer — and differ in the collaboration layer : multi-seat debates, tickets with narrowed scope, AI staff on a duty roster. Both install on one machine: ports, data directories, installer identity and update feeds are separate, so neither overwrites the other and no configuration is shared. If it's only you, SLATE is lighter. If you want people in the same discussion, or AI working by shift, use SLATE Teams. Where your data is Every conversation, seat, job, message and ledger entry lives in data/ inside the install directory as local SQLite files. Offline means no requests; the network is used only when you call a model API or check for updates. How to back it up — and why the two \"clear\" buttons are not the same thing — is in Projects & data. Next 1. Install & launch — set it up, add one model, open the first table. 2. Interface & tabs — what each of the six tabs holds, light and dark. 3. Office & AI staff — the part that is genuinely different here."}],"zh":[{"t":"认识 SLATE Teams","u":"zh/01-what-is-teams.html","s":"开始","h":["三件核心的事","六个顶层页签","与 SLATE 的关系","数据在哪","下一步"],"x":"SLATE Teams 跑在 你自己的机器上 ：不需要服务器，不上传对话，模型密钥只存在本机。 它把一件事变得顺手——让几个人和一批 AI 在同一个桌面上协同，并且每一笔都留得下痕迹。 产品名里的「席」是双关：一张桌子上的座位，也是入席的那件事。界面走「席 · Ledger」这套视觉身份—— 石墨纸面、红墨批注、直角、账簿式的发丝分隔线。 三件核心的事 位置 它管什么 去这几章 --- --- --- 议事厅 真人席位与 AI 席位同开一场讨论，主持人推进轮次，结论要人拍板 团队 办公室 AI 员工按值班表自己找活干，交付要过审校，账算在每个人头上 办公室 账本 谁说的、谁批的、花了多少 token，全部落库可查可备份 项目与数据 议事厅是 同一时刻 的协同——大家在一场讨论里；办公室是 不同时刻 的协同—— 你把活留下，AI 员工在它值班时做完，你回来验收。 六个顶层页签 - 对话 —— 常规的一对一会话，工具调用、审批、上下文预算都在这里。 - 团队 —— 议事厅。席位栏、议事流、待你签字三栏并排。 - 办公室 —— AI 员工名册、值班表、工位递话、交付队列。 - 黑板 —— 把讨论摊成逻辑链与工作流节点，看图推进。 - 扩展 —— 技能、MCP 服务、内置工具、回复模式、专家，能力都在这里开关。 - 设置 —— 模型、主题、语言、数据与隐私、AI 辅助功能逐项开关。 与 SLATE 的关系 SLATE Teams 是 SLATE 的同源分支，共用底座（对话、工具、技能、黑板、数据层）， 差别在 协作层 ：多人席位、票据与作用域收窄、AI 员工与值班表。 两者可以在同一台机器上并存：端口、数据目录、安装器身份与更新源都是分开的， 互相不覆盖，也不共用一份配置。 只你一个人用，SLATE 更轻；要拉人一起讨论、或者想让 AI 按班次自己干活，用 SLATE Teams。 数据在哪 所有会话、席位、活与话、账本都在安装目录的 data/ 下，是本地 SQLite 文件。 不联网就不产生任何请求；联网只发生在你调用模型 API 与拉取更新时。 怎么备份、怎么清、哪两种「清空」不是一回事，写在 项目与数据。 下一步 1. 安装与启动 —— 装好、配一个模型、开第一桌。 2. 界面与页签 —— 六张页签各装什么，明暗两套主题。 3. 办公室与 AI 员工 —— 这一版最不一样的地方。"}]};
